>\n<td>98 cm / 38.6 in</td>\n<td>111 cm / 43.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mother XL</td>\n<td></td>\n<td>57.5-65 kg / 127-143 lbs</td>\n<td>160-170 cm / 63.0-66.9 in</td>\n<td>104 cm / 40.9 in</td>\n<td>113 cm / 44.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>102 cm / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>113 cm / 44.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>The Green Lace Garden Mommy and Me Dresses bring a fresh, picnic-ready feel to matching family style. The soft green floral print keeps the silhouette airy and light, while the oversized lace collar frames the neckline with a polished, storybook finish that feels sweet without being fussy.</p>\n\n<p>From park strolls to vacation dinners, the puff sleeves and gathered skirt keep the dress looking dressed up while still feeling light and easy to wear. It is the kind of coordinated mother-daughter look that works beautifully for portraits, birthdays, and every sunny plan in between.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Green floral print:</strong> A soft garden-inspired print keeps the look fresh, bright, and photo-ready.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Oversized lace collar:</strong> The statement white collar adds a charming dress-up finish for mom and mini.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Puff short sleeves:</strong> Gentle volume at the shoulder keeps the silhouette sweet and summer friendly.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy gathered skirt:</strong> The relaxed midi shape moves beautifully for parties, vacations, and portraits.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Mom and mini matching:</strong> Coordinated mother-and-daughter styling makes family dressing feel effortless.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose your sizes and bring home a matching floral sundress set that feels ready for every warm-weather memory.</p>","tags":["Beach","Child 11-12yr","Child 4-5yr","Child 6-8yr","Child 9-10yr","Dresses","Floral","Garden","Girl Dress","Green","https://detail.1688.com/offer/1031966994369.html?","Lace Collar","Matching Family Dress","Matching Family Dresses","Midi Dress",